# UniMap .auditignore — consumed by project-profile detection
# (language/file counting -> adaptive scanner selection) only.
# NOTE (v1.18.2): individual scanners do NOT exclude these from scanning;
# use .audit-suppressions.json to filter noise findings from the report.
#
# Runtime / backup / vendored-copy trees that are not auditable source:
artifacts/
data/
backups/
archive/
docs_archive/
reports/
screenshots/
results/
monitoring/
claude-code-memory/
